    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase B3: Failure-path tests for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_catalog_exporter" kindref="compound">CatalogExporter</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Test IDs: MCH-EX01..MCH-EX04</para>
</simplesect>
MCH-EX01 <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_catalog_exporter" kindref="compound">CatalogExporter</ref> with HTTP 500 returns success=false with non-empty error MCH-EX02 <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_catalog_exporter" kindref="compound">CatalogExporter</ref> with HTTP 200 returns success=true MCH-EX03 <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_catalog_exporter_1a492acdf557e2efe8a04c51fb7d3a087d" kindref="member">CatalogExporter::publishSchema()</ref> with empty table list returns entities_published==0 MCH-EX04 DataHub type with HTTP 200 returns success=true</para>
<para>All tests inject a fake HTTP function via setHttpPostForTesting() — no real network I/O, no libcurl calls. Canonical PRNG seed: kExportSeed = 42.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="catalog__exporter_8h" kindref="compound">include/metadata/catalog_exporter.h</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/metadata/ROADMAP.md — Phase B export failure-path items </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
